> Hi Ista:
>
> Here's what I got:
>
> > library(plyr)
> > my_data <- data.frame(
> +    x = 1:10,
> +    y = 1:10 + rnorm(10),
> +    group = rep(c("A","B"), 5, 2),
> +    row.names = 101:110 # choosing recognizable names.
> +  )
