> >> 7   4  5.201775     B  104 4.488695  0.71308044
> >> 8   6  5.410108     B  106 6.293175 -0.88306722
> >> 9   8  8.030607     B  108 8.097656 -0.06704876
> >> 10 10 10.215686     B  110 9.902136  0.31355007
> >>
> >> In fact, any of the  fit/extract functions should work with this
> >> change in my_data.
> >>
> >> Dennis
