It's taken a while, mainly for me to learn git, but I've now implemented your idea to change the add_margins() column name allocation.

I've created my own github and forked Hadley's repository there and made the changes. If you want, you can download the source from https://github.com/duncandoo/reshape to get this version. The margin column name will appear as "all_" instead of (all).

Once you've got the source you'd have to install it instead of the CRAN version. I've recently discovered RStudio, which makes this extremely easy.

Duncan

